  "ingredients": [
    "1/2 tablespoon coconut oil",
    "1 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "salt (to taste)",
    "1/8 teaspoon black pepper",
    "2 large portobello mushrooms (de-stemmed)",
    "6 ounce ground beef",
    "1 tablespoon dijon mustard",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon black pepper",
    "1/4 cup cheddar cheese (shredded)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat your griddle to high. In a bowl, combine the coconut oil, garlic, oregano, salt, and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/guilt-free-portobello-bun-burgers/#wprm-recipe-50385-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/Guilt_Free_Portobello_Bun_Burgers-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Clean portobello mushrooms by scraping out the gills. Add portobello caps to marinade, brush to coat, and let them marinate until ready to grill the meat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/guilt-free-portobello-bun-burgers/#wprm-recipe-50385-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/Guilt_Free_Portobello_Bun_Burgers-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, combine ground beef, dijon, salt, pepper, and cheese. Form meat mixture into rounded patties.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/guilt-free-portobello-bun-burgers/#wprm-recipe-50385-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/Guilt_Free_Portobello_Bun_Burgers-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place “buns” on grill and let them cook for about 8 minutes or until heated through.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/guilt-free-portobello-bun-burgers/#wprm-recipe-50385-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/Guilt_Free_Portobello_Bun_Burgers-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add burger to the grill and cook for 5 minutes per side (medium rare).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/guilt-free-portobello-bun-burgers/#wprm-recipe-50385-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/Guilt_Free_Portobello_Bun_Burgers-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove portobello caps and burger from the grill.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/guilt-free-portobello-bun-burgers/#wprm-recipe-50385-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/Guilt_Free_Portobello_Bun_Burgers-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap that sweet burger between your two mushroom buns and lay on the fixin’s. Sugar free ketchup, onion, arugula, tomato – whatever you like! These are great served with our fried mac and cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/guilt-free-portobello-bun-burgers/#wprm-recipe-50385-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/10/Guilt_Free_Portobello_Bun_Burgers-1.jpg"
    }
  ],
